---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Nav from '../components/Nav.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import '../styles/global.css';
---
<Layout title="AI Demo Line — Prestique" description="Text Prestique's AI receptionist demo line to see how our AI handles tenant-side property-management scenarios live.">
  <Nav />
  <main class="pt-32 pb-24 px-6">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto prose-blog">
      <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold text-white mb-2">AI Demo Line</h1>
      <p class="text-p-muted text-sm mb-12">Try Prestique's AI receptionist live — text us any tenant scenario and see how it would handle the call.</p>

      <p>If you run a property management company and want to see how AI handles tenant-side calls — text or call our demo line with a maintenance scenario, lockout, or any tenant-side question you'd normally take by phone. Our AI replies in seconds with how it would handle the situation, including how it would dispatch to your vendors and notify you.</p>

      <h2>Text or call our demo line</h2>
      <p class="text-3xl font-bold text-white my-4">(727) 349-4509</p>
      <p>This is a US long-code phone number. Text or call any time — our AI receptionist is available 24/7 for demo conversations.</p>

      <h2>How it works</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Send a text describing any tenant-side scenario (AC out, lockout, leaking pipe, after-hours call, etc.)</li>
        <li>Our AI receptionist replies in 5–15 seconds with how it would handle the situation, in plain language</li>
        <li>Reply naturally — the AI handles multi-turn conversations and follows up appropriately</li>
        <li>If you want to evaluate the AI for your real portfolio, the demo will offer to send a scheduling link for a 15-minute discovery call with our team</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>SMS terms — please read before texting</h2>
      <p>By texting our demo line, you agree to receive multi-turn SMS responses from Prestique's AI receptionist demo. By initiating contact, you confirm that you are the authorized user of the phone number you message from, you are at least 18 years old, and you are located in the United States.</p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Message frequency:</strong> Varies based on the depth of your conversation, typically 2–10 messages per session, plus an optional one-time scheduling link.</li>
        <li><strong>Message and data rates may apply</strong> — standard carrier rates apply to all SMS communications.</li>
        <li><strong>Opt out:</strong> Reply <strong>STOP</strong> at any time. You will receive an acknowledgment and no further messages will be sent.</li>
        <li><strong>Re-engagement:</strong> If you have previously opted out and wish to resume, reply <strong>START</strong>, <strong>YES</strong>, or <strong>UNSTOP</strong>.</li>
        <li><strong>Help:</strong> Reply <strong>HELP</strong> to receive sender contact information.</li>
        <li><strong>Eligibility:</strong> The demo line is provided for legitimate evaluation of our services by US-based property management professionals.</li>
      </ul>
      <p><strong>No mobile information will be shared with third parties or affiliates for marketing or promotional purposes. Information sharing to subcontractors in support services, such as customer service or scheduling, is permitted. All other categories exclude text messaging originator opt-in data and consent; this information is not shared with any third parties.</strong></p>
      <p>For full details on how we handle your information, see our <a href="/privacy">Privacy Policy</a>. For the full terms governing use of this service, see our <a href="/terms">Terms of Service</a>.</p>

      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>Prestique LLC<br />North Carolina, United States<br /><a href="mailto:support@prestique.ai">support@prestique.ai</a></p>
    </div>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</Layout>
